bject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2]): fully_preserved - the whitewashed walls, grey tiled eaves, carved lattice door, grey stone walkway, mossed wall base, stone drums, and red paper lantern are all retained as the only setting, replacing the white studio backdrop entirely.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is a fashion-editorial piece shot in a traditional Chinese courtyard, with a hard contrast between the subject's black tailoring and the chalk-white plaster walls, cool overcast daylight, and one warm accent from a paper lantern.\n[Shot 1] A medium-wide full-body shot centres <Subject 1>, the young woman whose appearance comes from <Picture 1>, walking along the stone-slab walkway of <Subject 2>. Behind her the whitewashed wall rises to a band of grey tiled eaves, the carved lattice door sits in shadow on the left, and the red lantern hangs still on the right edge of the frame. The camera holds at chest height and begins a slow forward dolly at a steady walking pace, retreating ahead of her with a narrow margin above the bun and below the heels. She steps forward three times; the blazer hem lifts a little at each stride, the satin peak lapels flash as her shoulders turn, the sleeve crease opens at the elbow, and her stiletto heels strike the stone slabs in crisp, uneven clicks. On the third step she halts, shifts her weight onto her right leg, and brings her left hand up to rest along the seam of the jacket at her hip. Her chin settles level and her gaze travels from the space left of the lens back into the lens itself.\n[Shot 2] At 00:03.200, the shot cuts to a head-and-shoulders close-up of <Subject 1> in the same courtyard, the whitewashed wall and a strip of grey tile eave now a soft, evenly out-of-focus field behind her, the lattice pattern reduced to a faint dark grid. Her face fills the centre of the frame at a slight three-quarter angle, the loose edge of her hair and the gold earring both sharp, the taut line of the twisted bun visible above her crown. The camera pushes in almost imperceptibly and then settles. She turns her head a few degrees toward the lens, and the long geometric earring swings once and comes to rest against her jaw. A single strand of hair slips free at her temple. She blinks slowly, her lips part slightly on an intake of breath, and her eyes hold the lens without a smile, her expression composed and faintly cool. The lighting stays soft and directionless under cloud, one gentle falloff along her right cheek, one clean highlight on the satin lapel, and a thin warm rim from the lantern along her left shoulder.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nA quiet enclosed-courtyard tone runs throughout, with the crisp, slightly irregular click of stiletto heels on stone slabs at the start of [Shot 1], a light rustle of jacket fabric on each stride, distant sparrows and a faint bamboo rustle beyond the wall, and a single soft breath in [Shot 2].\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA sparse low synth drone under one plucked guzheng string that repeats slowly, entering quietly in [Shot 1] and thinning to the held drone through [Shot 2], with no percussion and no swell.\n"}}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [71], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "links": [], "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [383.8699951171875, 591.4200439453125], "pos": [1343.565501779322, 276.2303497954049], "widgets_values": ["5956c843a34a459265d1e3c4ec66280872257397f0a0b0b69d6e62e2fd1620c4.jpg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 60, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 6, "widgets_values_named": {"image": "5956c843a34a459265d1e3c4ec66280872257397f0a0b0b69d6e62e2fd1620c4.jpg", "upload": "image"}},